@startuml ActivityTest
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Processing : Start [ready] / initialize() \; start_timer() \;
Processing --> Completed : Finish / cleanup() \; stop_timer() \;
Processing --> Error : Failure [error_count < 3] / log_error() \;
Error --> Idle : Retry / reset_state() \;
Completed --> [*]

Idle: entry: setup_resources() \;
Processing: entry: begin_work() \;
Processing: exit: save_progress() \;
Error: entry: handle_error() \;
@enduml